sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Seller
  participant C as Catalog
  participant AI as AI service
  participant K as Kafka
  participant Co as Commerce
  participant SR as Search
  actor A as Admin
  S->>C: POST /products (HSN, GST rate, legal fields, variants)
  C->>C: seller in verified_seller_projection?
  C->>C: status PENDING_CHECKS
  C->>C: rules: banned items and words, required details, image size, brand
  C->>AI: category fit and wording help
  AI-->>C: suggestion with confidence
  alt all pass
    C->>C: ACTIVE, ProductPublished
  else clear failure
    C->>C: REJECTED with fixable reason, ListingRejected
  else unsure
    C->>C: PENDING_APPROVAL
    A->>C: approve or reject with reason (MFA)
  end
  C--)K: ProductPublished
  K--)Co: update product_projection
  K--)SR: index product
